# Client-confidential — SalonTouch field acquisition (PII/financials, keep local).
# The WHOLE directory, not just salontouch-*: `uvalux-loop-artifact.html` is the
# same twelve-year financial history of a real (closed) salon group, reframed for
# the pitch, and it slipped past the narrower pattern into a commit on 2026-09-02.
# This repo is PUBLIC. Nothing derived from that acquisition belongs in it.
docs/research/
# Commercial pricing for a named client — repo is public.
docs/pitch/PROPOSAL-PHASE1-UVALUX.md

# Raw salon training audio — 1.7 GB of FLAC across 18 files, the largest 457 MB.
# GitHub rejects any single file over 100 MB, and this repo is public: these are
# UVALUX's own recorded training sessions. Kept on disk, never tracked.
# The TRANSCRIPTS and the mined claims under data/salon-transcripts/ ARE tracked
# and are the artefacts anything downstream actually reads.
data/salon-transcripts/audio/

# Raw meeting recordings and outbound send notes — this remote is PUBLIC.
# Derived analyses in docs/meetings/ ARE tracked; the raw recordings are not
# (private multi-person conversations), and the SEND-NOTE files carry partner
# email addresses that do not belong in a public repo.
docs/meetings/*-transcript.txt
docs/pitch/SEND-NOTE-*.md
